{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220670","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220670","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1322067001:0":{"text":"데이먼, 데이먼... 자니?","source_cn":"戴蒙，戴蒙……你睡了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF922666A403DFBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322067002:0":{"text":"데이먼... 장난감 목마를 가지고 싶어 했잖니? 엄마, 아빠가 널 위해 하나 만들어왔어.","source_cn":"戴蒙……你不是一直很想要玩具木马吗？妈妈爸爸给你做了一个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D71187FF02D30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322067003:0":{"text":"그리 예쁘진 않지만... 네 마음에 들었으면 좋겠구나...","source_cn":"不是很精美，但……但我们希望你能喜欢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41574E28C5A40CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322067004:1":{"text":"데이먼?","source_cn":"戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F535C6B7FB97988","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322067005:1":{"text":"너무 속상하고, 화가 난 탓인지 데이먼은 아무런 대꾸가 없었다.","source_cn":"或许是因为太伤心，太生气，戴蒙一句话都没有说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE37ACAD12321C84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322067006:1":{"text":"데이먼... 이제 화 좀 풀어보렴, 응? 데이먼?","source_cn":"戴蒙……别生妈妈的气，好不好？戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DF23D8F640E8180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322067007:1":{"text":"많이 속상할지도 모르니... 치치를 돌려주는 게 어떨까?","source_cn":"他应该很难受，要不……咱们把奇奇还给他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF5795AFF863B618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322067008:1":{"text":"하지만 치치를 돌려주면, 데이먼은 분명 또 참지 못하고 뛰쳐나가게 될 거예요... 안돼요, 치치는 돌려줄 수 없어요!","source_cn":"但是要是有了奇奇，戴蒙肯定又会忍不住跑出去……不行，奇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9AE7AA16B080E91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322067009:1":{"text":"휴... 여보, 데이먼에게 너무 그렇게 엄격하게 대하지 않는 게 좋을 것 같아.","source_cn":"唉……吾爱，也别对他太严苛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF4824C23D88C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322067010:1":{"text":"다른 방법을 생각해 봐요... 어떻게 해야 데이먼의 기분을 좀 풀어줄 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1322067010":{"text":"다른 방법을 생각해 봐요... 어떻게 해야 데이먼의 기분을 좀 풀어줄 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322067011:1":{"text":"치치를 압수했으니 혼자서 얼마나 외롭겠어요. 데이먼의 기분은 친구가 있어야 풀어진다구요!","source_cn":"你们没收了奇奇，他一个人多孤单，只有玩伴才能让他开心起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE99B03CA0A391F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322067012:1":{"text":"음... 만약 데이먼이 외출하는 게 불편하다면 여기서 “친구를 만들어” 봐요.","source_cn":"唔……要是戴蒙不方便出门的话，那我们就在这里“制造玩伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8F8E412CFD5901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322067013:1":{"text":"다들 겨울 제전에서 마법사 비츠와프와 그가 마법으로 만든 여기저기 돌아다니던 작은 눈사람 기억하고 계시나요?","source_cn":"你们还记不记得冬日祭典上那个叫维茨瓦夫的魔法师，还有他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x659EEABC033CB0A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322067014:1":{"text":"눈사람을 만든 다음, 마법으로 생명을 불어넣으면 데이먼의 친구가 되어 같이 놀 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1322067014":{"text":"눈사람을 만든 다음, 마법으로 생명을 불어넣으면 데이먼의 친구가 되어 같이 놀 수 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能陪戴蒙玩耍啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322067015:3":{"text":"눈사람을 만든다고요? 음... 데이먼이 나가서 노는 것보다는 훨씬 안전하겠네요.","source_cn":"堆雪人？嗯……这样比让戴蒙跑出门安全多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC5224C1AF82BEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1322067016:1":{"text":"그럼 눈사람을 많이 만들어요!","source_cn":"那我们就堆好多个雪人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1789F721173E238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:0:1":{"text":"좋은 생각이야!","source_cn":"好提议！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2A6EAEF5A467EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"좋은 생각이야!","female":"좋은 생각이야!","variant_male_record_index":"70480","variant_female_record_index":"70481","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:20:1:2":{"text":"그래... 눈사람도 친구이긴 하니까","source_cn":"行吧……雪人也算是玩伴","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB10B6D7533039ED7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래... 눈사람도 친구이긴 하니까","female":"그래... 눈사람도 친구이긴 하니까","variant_male_record_index":"70482","variant_female_record_index":"70483","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"데이먼에게는 친구가 필요해!","source_cn":"他需要的是朋友！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF8BD98B94BC43FD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"데이먼에게는 친구가 필요해!","female":"데이먼에게는 친구가 필요해!","variant_male_record_index":"70478","variant_female_record_index":"70479","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"세미라","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:尼汝":{"text":"니루","source":"尼汝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":5}}